    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p13_b5",
      "text": "We evaluate LBR on a comprehensive suite of benchmarks spanning four key categories: General LVLM Benchmarks,\nText-intensive Tasks, Visual QA Tasks, and Image Caption Tasks.\n",
      "bbox": [
        54.97,
        191.13,
        542.68,
        213.21
      ],
