      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 173,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p13_b6",
      "text": "Text-intensive Tasks. In Table 1, we use abbreviations for the following benchmarks, which test a model\u2019s ability to\nunderstand and reason about dense text within images:\n",
      "bbox": [
        55.11,
        221.02,
        541.44,
        243.1
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        220,
        884,
        2165,
        972
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 10.06,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Medi",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 170,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p13_b7",
      "text": "\u2022 TextVQA (VQAText) (Singh et al., 2019): A benchmark that requires models to read and comprehend text in images to\nanswer questions. We report results on the validation split.\n",
      "bbox": [
        66.9,
        255.65,
        541.45,
        278.98
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        267,
        1022,
        2165,
        1115
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 9.96,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 176,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p13_b8",
      "text": "\u2022 ChartQA (VQAChart) (Masry et al., 2022): A visual question answering dataset focused on understanding and\nreasoning about chart images. Evaluation is performed on the human-generated subset of the test split.\n",
      "bbox": [
        66.9,
        286.55,
        541.44,
        309.88
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        267,
        1146,
