    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p13_b14",
      "text": "\u2022 ScienceQA (SQAI) (Lu et al., 2022): A large-scale multimodal benchmark featuring multiple-choice science questions\nderived from elementary to high school curricula. We evaluate on the subset of questions that include image context\n(SQAI) using the test split.\n",
      "bbox": [
