      "text": "\u2022 RealWorldQA (RWQA) (xAI, 2024): RealWorldQA is a benchmark designed for real-world understanding. The\ndataset consists of anonymized images taken from vehicles, in addition to other real-world images. We report results\non the official test split.\n",
