      "text": "\u2022 MMBench (MMBen) (Liu et al., 2024d): A multi-dimensional benchmark that evaluates core multimodal capabilities\nsuch as perception, reasoning, and attribute recognition using a circular evaluation strategy. We report results on the\nEnglish version using the dev split.\n",
